Search skills by query with explicit scope flags

Usage: fastskill skill search [OPTIONS] <query>

Arguments:
  <query>  Search query string

Options:
      --local                    Search local/installed skills only
      --global                   Use global skills directory (~/.config/fastskill/skills)
      --remote                   Search remote skill catalogs
      --repository <repository>  Limit remote search to specific repository
  -v, --verbose                  Enable verbose output
  -l, --limit <limit>            Maximum number of results [default: 10]
  -f, --format <format>          Output format: table, json, grid, xml
      --json                     Shorthand for --format json
      --embedding <embedding>    Use embedding search: true, false, or auto
      --skills-dir <skills-dir>  Skills directory path (overrides default discovery)
      --paths                    Output resolved file paths instead of search results (--local only)
      --content <content>        Content to include in JSON output: none, preview, full (--local
                                 --paths only)
  -h, --help                     Print help
  -V, --version                  Print version

Syntax: skill search <QUERY> [--local|--remote] [OPTIONS]

Examples:
  fastskill skill search "pdf generation" --local
  fastskill skill search "presentation builder" --remote --limit 5
